@startuml

title Plant Program

class Program {
    + Main() : void
    + DisplayMenu() : void
}

note right of Program
    The program class is the entry point
    of the Plant program. The menu is
    shown to the user and where the user
    can select from menu. The methods
    are then initiated in PlantHub.
end note

abstract class Plant {
    
    - _name : string
    - _plantType : string
    - _PurchaseDate: DateTime
    - _StoreName : string
    - _price : int
    - _isSold : bool
    - _gaveAway : bool

    + GetName() : string
    + MarkSold() : void
    + MarkGaveAway() : void
    + DisplayPlant() : string
    + CareNotes(): string


}

note right of Plant
    This is the abstract base class
    needed to run the program. It
    declares the shared attributes, behaviors,
    and constructors.
end note

class Epipremnum {

    - _isTrailing : bool
    - _hasPole : bool
    - _isVariegated : bool
    - _isRare: bool
    - _isCommon: bool

    + DisplayPlant(): string
    + CareNotes() : string

}

note right of Epipremnum
    Inherits from abstract class Plant
    and includes if its trailing or mosspole.
end note

class Succulent {

    - _isSpiky : bool
    - _isBush : bool

    + DisplayPlant() : string
    + CareNotes : string

}

note right of Succulent
    Inherits from Parent Plant class and
    has more details on the type of growth
    the succulent has.
end note

class Begonia {

    - _isCane : bool
    - _isBush : bool
    - _flowerColor : string

    + DisplayPlant() : string
    + CareNotes : string
}

note right of Begonia
    Inherits from abstract class Plant
    They have different watering patterns and care
end note

class Propogation {

    - _plantType : string
    - _propCount : int
    - _mediumUsed : string

    + DisplayPlant() : string
    + CareNotes : string

}

note right of Propogation
    It is a class its own and represents
    the props that the user is wanting
    to make and to keep track of.
end note

abstract class PlantCare {

    - _frequency : string
    - _previouslyCompleted : DateTime

    + DisplayCare() : string
    + MarkCompleted() : void
    + GetFrequency() : string
}

note right of PlantCare
    Abstract base class for all Plant
    care needed. Stores frequency and tracking
    of care type routines.
end note

class Watering {

    - _waterSource : string

    + DisplayCare() : string
}

note right of Watering
    This class handles the watering routine of
    the different plant types. There are 3 types
    of water used.
end note

class Sunlight {

    - _lightType : string

    + DisplayCare() : string
}

note right of Sunlight
    This class handles sunlight requirements
    such as filtered, indirect,
    or direct light.
end note

class PlantHub {

    - _plants : List<Plant>

    + AddPlant(Plant) : void
    + DisplayPlants() : void
    + RemovePlant(int) : void
    + MarkPlantSold(int) : void
    + MarkPlantDonated(int) : void
}

note right of PlantHub
    Manages the plant collection and
    performs all plant-related actions.
end note

Program --> PlantHub
PlantHub "1" *-- "*" Plant

Plant <|-- Epipremnum
Plant <|-- Succulent
Plant <|-- Begonia
Plant <|-- Propagation

Plant "1" o-- "*" PlantCare
PlantCare <|-- Watering
PlantCare <|-- Fertilizing
PlantCare <|-- Sunlight

@enduml